          "docs": "<p>Detaches one or more traffic sources from the specified Auto Scaling group.</p> <p>When you detach a taffic, it enters the <code>Removing</code> state while deregistering the instances in the group. When all instances are deregistered, then you can no longer describe the traffic source using the <a>DescribeTrafficSources</a> API call. The instances continue to run.</p>"
